        {"zh": "我们三个分开了位置", "en": "The three of us spread out"},
        {"zh": "我的影子在地上拉长", "en": "My shadow stretches out"},
        {"zh": "我停在离你不远的地方", "en": "I stop not far from you"},
        {"zh": "空气里有野味了", "en": "The air carries a wild scent"},
        {"zh": "我压低身子站定", "en": "I settle low and still"},
        {"zh": "我朝同伴的方向看了一眼", "en": "I glance at my fellows"},
        {"zh": "我的脚印一串连着来", "en": "A line of prints comes on"},
        {"zh": "我压低身子走到前面", "en": "I creep to the front"},
        {"zh": "我从两棵树之间挤出来", "en": "I slip out between two trees"}
